{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_203_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年，春，齊侯伐莒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"二、宋華亥、向寧、華定自宋南里出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"自宋南里者，專也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"三、大蒐於昌間。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"秋而曰蒐。此春也，其曰蒐何也？以蒐事也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月，乙丑，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"五、六月，叔鞅如京師，葬景王。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"六、王室亂。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"亂之為言，事未有所成也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"七、劉子、單子以王猛居於皇。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也，王猛嫌也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"八、秋，劉子、單子以王猛入於王城。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。入者，內弗受也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"九、冬，十月，王子猛卒。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"此不卒者也。其曰卒，失嫌也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_203_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_203","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，癸酉，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}